1
00:00:05,291 --> 00:00:08,125
We're swaying on horseback

2
00:00:08,125 --> 00:00:09,916
The hills are green

3
00:00:09,916 --> 00:00:12,208
And the birdies sing

4
00:00:12,208 --> 00:00:14,833
And roses are pink

5
00:00:14,833 --> 00:00:17,375
Experience I never had

6
00:00:17,375 --> 00:00:19,125
I'm so happy

7
00:00:19,125 --> 00:00:23,750
Happy to just be part of your story

8
00:00:24,583 --> 00:00:29,208
After you I follow

9
00:00:29,208 --> 00:00:33,791
The world you show me broaden my horizon

10
00:00:33,791 --> 00:00:38,458
Forever my hero

11
00:00:38,458 --> 00:00:45,000
I am your biggest fan

12
00:00:46,791 --> 00:00:48,583
Merry-go-round

13
00:00:48,583 --> 00:00:51,166
In a circle I run

14
00:00:51,166 --> 00:00:56,625
It's so much fun leaving reality behind

15
00:01:00,625 --> 00:01:03,541
I fall down the horseback

16
00:01:03,541 --> 00:01:05,333
With my crippled legs

17
00:01:05,333 --> 00:01:07,583
And then it starts to rain

18
00:01:07,583 --> 00:01:10,125
Showing me it's all fake

19
00:01:10,125 --> 00:01:12,750
Raindrops wash down the facade

20
00:01:12,750 --> 00:01:14,500
Hills are painted

21
00:01:14,500 --> 00:01:16,791
Birdies are robotic

22
00:01:16,791 --> 00:01:19,958
Roses are made of clay

23
00:01:19,958 --> 00:01:24,583
Excitement that I feel

24
00:01:24,583 --> 00:01:26,333
Return them to the shelf

25
00:01:26,333 --> 00:01:29,125
Cause now I understand

26
00:01:29,125 --> 00:01:33,750
Heroes cannot be real

27
00:01:33,750 --> 00:01:36,083
I wasn't who I am

28
00:01:36,083 --> 00:01:38,625
I don't know who I am

29
00:01:39,250 --> 00:01:45,083
¿Who am I?

30
00:01:46,791 --> 00:01:48,625
Here we go, another lap

31
00:01:48,625 --> 00:01:49,708
Prizes to claim

32
00:01:49,708 --> 00:01:51,250
Here's a dream for you

33
00:01:51,250 --> 00:01:52,916
Here's a dream for me

34
00:01:52,916 --> 00:01:55,916
Golden tickets in my bag stay unexchanged

35
00:01:55,916 --> 00:01:59,083
Don't you love the thrill of the chase?

36
00:01:59,541 --> 00:02:01,125
Just let me be your fan

37
00:02:01,125 --> 00:02:02,625
I wanna be your fan

38
00:02:02,625 --> 00:02:05,458
I'm still your biggest fan

39
00:02:07,916 --> 00:02:15,666
Why is it that some were given the role of villian

40
00:02:15,666 --> 00:02:22,708
The moment they were released into this system?

41
00:02:25,083 --> 00:02:25,958
Stand up

42
00:02:25,958 --> 00:02:27,041
Gallop on

43
00:02:27,041 --> 00:02:33,833
Nothing can be done by feeling so sorry for myself

44
00:02:33,833 --> 00:02:35,166
Hero

45
00:02:35,166 --> 00:02:37,333
On a plastic horse

46
00:02:37,333 --> 00:02:39,041
Fighting like it's real

47
00:02:39,041 --> 00:02:43,041
With a cardboard sword

48
00:02:43,041 --> 00:02:44,458
I know

49
00:02:44,458 --> 00:02:48,458
Successful or not, I am who I am

50
00:02:48,458 --> 00:02:53,500
I am my biggest fan

51
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:56,958
I am my enemy and my friend

52
00:02:56,958 --> 00:02:58,291
Hero

53
00:02:58,291 --> 00:03:02,000
Gonna prove my version of justice

54
00:03:02,000 --> 00:03:06,083
Is more just than yours

55
00:03:06,083 --> 00:03:07,458
Uno

56
00:03:07,458 --> 00:03:11,583
Remaining on this stage, I am the only one

57
00:03:11,583 --> 00:03:16,583
I am my biggest fan

58
00:03:16,583 --> 00:03:20,666
I am my enemy and my friend